---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Faber Concrete"
  description="Terms governing use of the Faber Concrete website and estimate requests in Metro Detroit."
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed">
    <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-4xl uppercase">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Last updated: July 22, 2026</p>
    <p>
      Welcome to Faber Concrete. By accessing this website or submitting an estimate request, you agree to these Terms of Service.
    </p>
    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl uppercase">1. Estimate &amp; Appointment Requests</h2>
    <p>
      Submitting a form does not create a binding construction contract. All pricing, scope, and scheduling are confirmed in writing after an on-site inspection by Matt Faber.
    </p>
    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl uppercase">2. Workmanship &amp; Governing Law</h2>
    <p>
      Actual concrete work is governed by your signed written contract. These website terms are governed by the laws of the State of Michigan.
    </p>
    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl uppercase">3. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE.name} · {SITE.address.formatted} · {SITE.phone}
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
